35","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"40424","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"70900","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"92510","synopsis":"Keisuke Takahashi of the RedSuns is on the hunt for the mysterious ghost driver of Akina that defeated him with a shocking drift technique. Upon hearing this rumour, Iketani goes out to locate this monstrous Eight-Six only to learn that it belongs to Takumi’s own dad.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70900/27675.jpg"},{"title":"Downhill Specialist Arrives","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"135","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"40424","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"70900","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"92511","synopsis":"The Akina SpeedStars have taken the challenge of the RedSuns, but Iketani won’t be able to compete in the upcoming battle. By chance, he hopes he can get Bunta Fujiwara to race in his place.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70900/27676.jpg"},{"title":"The Battle Begins","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"135","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"40424","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"70900","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"92512","synopsis":"Iketani patiently waits for Bunta to appear to drive for his team against Keisuke Takahashi, but to his surprise, Takumi shows up in his place, reluctantly. This puts everybody in a state of shock, as the unexpected is about to happen.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70900/27677.jpg"},{"title":"Dogfight!","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"135","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"40424","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"70900","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"92513","synopsis":"Everyone in the crowd is speechless as they have just witnessed the impossible, an Eight-Six overtaking Keisuke’s FD. Ryosuke goes up to solve what’s the success behind this somewhat simple car to discover its unexpected secret. The next day Takumi goes out on a date with Natsuki to the beach, and the thrilling thoughts of racing have started to interest him.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70900/27678.jpg"},{"title":"A New Challenger","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"135","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"40424","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"70900","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"92514","synopsis":"While Ryosuke is practicing with his FC on Akina’s course, a more menacing vehicle appears from behind. Meanwhile Takumi is asked how he earned his godly drifting skills as Iketani wishes to see a demonstration first hand.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70900/27679.jpg"},{"title":"Pride of a Racer","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"135","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"40424","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"70900","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"92515","synopsis":"More history behind Takumi's and Natsuki is revealed. Nakazato of the Nightkids wants to challenge this mysterious Eight-Six, but he assumes that its driver has agreed to do so. As Takumi ponders why he should take up the challenge, various people plan on making him change his mind.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70900/27680.jpg"},{"title":"Time`s Almost Up","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"135","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"40424","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"70900","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"92516","synopsis":"The countdown to the night’s battle is closing in as everyone has gathered, but where is the Eight-Six? Itsuki will have to make an embarrassing apology to everyone if his best friend decides not to show.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70900/27681.jpg"},{"title":"Battle to the Limit","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"135","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"40424","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"70900","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"92517","synopsis":"Nakazato faces off with Takumi, using his grip technique against Takumi's drift technique. Who will come out on top?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70900/27682.jpg"},{"title":"The Five Consecutive Hairpins","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"135","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"40424","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"70900","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"92518","synopsis":"Nakazato has underestimated Akina’s Eight-Six, and he might just be in trouble as the five consecutive hairpins are upon him. Also to everyone’s surprise, Itsuki buys a new car.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70900/27683.jpg"},{"title":"Shingo Arrives","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"135","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"185","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"40424","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"70900","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"92519","synopsis":"To prove the potential of Itsuki’s new car, Takumi drives it against a minor racing team from Gunma. Members of the NightKids has been appearing more often, so on the night that Iketani drives out his S13, Shingo appears from behind with deadly intents.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70900/27684.jpg"},{"title":"The FR Killer","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"135","scope":"R","episodeNumbe